 "turns": [
  {
   "index": 0,
   "speaker": "Lorraine",
   "text": "Hello, everyone. Let's start with plots. We have thirty-six this year.",
   "agenda_item": "season",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E001"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 1,
   "speaker": "Gordon",
   "text": "Twenty-nine returning gardeners, and seven new ones. That fills every plot.",
   "agenda_item": "season",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E002",
    "E003"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 2,
   "speaker": "Sunny",
   "text": "Do the new gardeners get the plots by the gate? Those are the hardest to keep watered.",
   "agenda_item": "season",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E004"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 3,
   "speaker": "Lorraine",
   "text": "They do, but we'll pair each one with a returning gardener for the first month.",
   "agenda_item": "season",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E005"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 4,
   "speaker": "Gordon",
   "text": "That worked well last year.",
   "agenda_item": "season",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 5,
   "speaker": "Ahmed",
   "text": "And the fee is still forty?",
   "agenda_item": "season",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E006",
    "E007"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 6,
   "speaker": "Gordon",
   "text": "Forty for the season. No change.",
   "agenda_item": "season",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E008"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 7,
   "speaker": "Lorraine",
   "text": "I'll send the plot assignments and the pairing list by email this weekend.",
   "agenda_item": "season",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E009"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 8,
   "speaker": "Sunny",
   "text": "Thanks, Lorraine.",
   "agenda_item": "season",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 9,
   "speaker": "Lorraine",
   "text": "Water. Ahmed?",
   "agenda_item": "water",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E010"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 10,
   "speaker": "Ahmed",
   "text": "We have twelve rain barrels now, and they made a real difference to the bill.",
   "agenda_item": "water",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E011"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 11,
   "speaker": "Gordon",
   "text": "I count ten on the inventory. Two were promised but never arrived.",
   "agenda_item": "water",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E012"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 12,
   "speaker": "Ahmed",
   "text": "Ten, right. The other two are still at the factory.",
   "agenda_item": "water",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E013"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 13,
   "speaker": "Sunny",
   "text": "What was the water bill last year?",
   "agenda_item": "water",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E014"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 14,
   "speaker": "Gordon",
   "text": "Nine hundred and sixty. Down from about twelve hundred the year before.",
   "agenda_item": "water",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E015"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 15,
   "speaker": "Ahmed",
   "text": "Barrels are eighty-five each new. But a juice factory nearby gives away used ones.",
   "agenda_item": "water",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E016"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 16,
   "speaker": "Lorraine",
   "text": "Used ones would be lovely, if they're clean.",
   "agenda_item": "water",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 17,
   "speaker": "Ahmed",
   "text": "They need a good scrub. That's all.",
   "agenda_item": "water",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 18,
   "speaker": "Gordon",
   "text": "The barrels really want labels on them, too, so nobody drinks from them.",
   "agenda_item": "water",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E017"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 19,
   "speaker": "Lorraine",
   "text": "Then we'll take the used barrels from the factory instead of buying new.",
   "agenda_item": "water",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E018"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 20,
   "speaker": "Ahmed",
   "text": "I'll pick up six from the factory next Saturday.",
   "agenda_item": "water",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E019"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 21,
   "speaker": "Sunny",
   "text": "The road by the factory is closed for the new bridge. You have to go all the way around.",
   "agenda_item": "water",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E020"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 22,
   "speaker": "Gordon",
   "text": "That bridge has been \"nearly finished\" for two years.",
   "agenda_item": "water",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 23,
   "speaker": "Lorraine",
   "text": "Sunny, the seedling sale.",
   "agenda_item": "water",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 24,
   "speaker": "Sunny",
   "text": "The sale is on April twelfth. I've grown about eight hundred seedlings.",
   "agenda_item": "seedling_sale",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E021",
    "E022"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 25,
   "speaker": "Gordon",
   "text": "That's a lot of tomatoes.",
   "agenda_item": "seedling_sale",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 26,
   "speaker": "Sunny",
   "text": "Tomatoes, peppers, kale and some herbs.",
   "agenda_item": "seedling_sale",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 27,
   "speaker": "Lorraine",
   "text": "Are we keeping the price at three dollars?",
   "agenda_item": "seedling_sale",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E023",
    "E024"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 28,
   "speaker": "Sunny",
   "text": "Three dollars, or four for the bigger pots.",
   "agenda_item": "seedling_sale",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 29,
   "speaker": "Ahmed",
   "text": "Who's helping on the day? Last year you were alone at the table for hours.",
   "agenda_item": "seedling_sale",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E025"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 30,
   "speaker": "Sunny",
   "text": "Nobody yet.",
   "agenda_item": "seedling_sale",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 31,
   "speaker": "Gordon",
   "text": "I can do the morning.",
   "agenda_item": "seedling_sale",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E026"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 32,
   "speaker": "Ahmed",
   "text": "And I'll do the afternoon, after the barrels.",
   "agenda_item": "seedling_sale",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E027"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 33,
   "speaker": "Lorraine",
   "text": "Maybe we could put up a sign at the library too? People there love plants.",
   "agenda_item": "seedling_sale",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E028",
    "E029"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 34,
   "speaker": "Sunny",
   "text": "The table needs to be in the shade this year. The basil wilted last time.",
   "agenda_item": "seedling_sale",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 35,
   "speaker": "Lorraine",
   "text": "Last thing. The shed. Gordon?",
   "agenda_item": "shed",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E030"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 36,
   "speaker": "Gordon",
   "text": "The roof leaks and the door's off its hinges again. The quote to fix both is eleven hundred.",
   "agenda_item": "shed",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E031"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 37,
   "speaker": "Ahmed",
   "text": "Can we afford it?",
   "agenda_item": "shed",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E032"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 38,
   "speaker": "Gordon",
   "text": "The balance is twenty-eight fifty. So yes, but it's a big chunk.",
   "agenda_item": "shed",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E033"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 39,
   "speaker": "Sunny",
   "text": "The sale should bring in a good amount. That would help.",
   "agenda_item": "shed",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 40,
   "speaker": "Lorraine",
   "text": "Let's wait until after the seedling sale, and then decide on the shed.",
   "agenda_item": "shed",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E034"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 41,
   "speaker": "Gordon",
   "text": "The door I can fix again in the meantime. I'm getting good at it.",
   "agenda_item": "shed",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E035"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 42,
   "speaker": "Lorraine",
   "text": "Thank you, Gordon. That's everything. See you all in the garden.",
   "agenda_item": "shed",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  }
 ],
